messages ({(["id":1,"body":"Hi, knights:
    I might be doing the following stuffs for knight guild:
    (1) Horses, yeah, knight will be able to ride a horse while attacking
        enemys. This will increase your mobility and defense. And your
        horse can 'carry' all your inventory except equiped things. Thus
        your dex won't be reduced when you are carrying lot of things.

    (2) A training yard for knight only. You can fight there until level
        10 without the threaten of being killed. (The trainer won't kill
        you when you are defeated.)

    (3) King Yaramon has decided a plan about striking back. Knights will
        have missions from the king to earn war score. These are called
        'quests' in history, however, we use the word 'mission' here
        instead.

    (4) If I still have time, your goldeb sabre will increase its power
        when you raise your level, recieve knighthood... etc.

                                                     - Annihilator
","title":"Plan on Knight Guild","time":779358852,"poster":"Annihilator",]),(["id":2,"title":"比武招親羅!!","body":"話說那鍋.....咱們Alomar(死神阿修羅 )姊姊年歲已高...
不....是已達適婚年齡..想找個如意郎君...
但是放眼各方英雄好漢實在不知如何取捨....所以特地交代小弟籌畫比武招親

資格: 男性,未婚,not monk
時間: 9-17 (Friday) 中午 1:30開始
地點: 古梅武鬥場
規則: 1. 採擂臺賽..順序抽籤
      2. 先逃走為輸
      3. 如果一隻逃走沒死..另一隻留在原地死了...活的贏
      4. 如果兩隻都死..跟bebo pk 贏者勝
      5. 最後的優勝者要跟Alomar再比一場..贏了才可以抱得美人歸
      6. 比賽完買上辦婚禮...禮金禮物請先備妥
      7. 比賽中不得用藥或繃帶...但是可以用magic..healer can heal..etc.
   scholar can use unknow mage can use cast.......
      8. 比完後免費醫療由Jschen提供

請在星期五前報名...mail to Alomar
意者請在這幾天好好存exp..:P
ps: 可以現場報名
pss: 請好心的wiz or God 蒞臨指導

